              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Athumba izikhulu ezimbili zakwaMidiyani, o-Orebi noZebi; bambulala u-Orebi edwaleni lika-Orebi, uZebi wababulala esikhamweni sewayini sikaZebi, wabaxosha abakwaMidiyani, baletha ikhanda lika-Orebi nelikaZebi kuGideyoni phesheya kweJordani.",
          "type": "text",
